      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$1/x_1^2=e^{-2t}$，$\\int e^{-2t}dt=-\\frac12e^{-2t}$，故 $x_2=e^t\\cdot(-\\frac12e^{-2t})=-\\frac12e^{-t}$，吸收常数即 $x_2=e^{-t}$",
            "一般解：$x=C_1e^t+C_2e^{-t}$，与特征方程法（$r^2-1=0,r=\\pm1$）结果一致，验证方法正确"
